h conversation, never sell or share it for advertising, and delete it whenever you ask.\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-10 divide-y divide-line-soft border-t border-line-soft\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",\"1. Who handles your data\",{\"className\":\"py-7 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink sm:col-span-1\",\"children\":\"1. Who handles your data\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted sm:col-span-2 sm:mt-0\",\"children\":\"Maridots is an international cross-border technology research initiative jointly developed and managed with administrative oversight in Tunisia. Messages sent through this site are processed by the international team and reach the info@maridots.com mailbox. For any question about your data, write to info@maridots.com.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"2. What we collect\",{\"className\":\"py-7 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink sm:col-span-1\",\"children\":\"2. What we collect\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted sm:col-span-2 sm:mt-0\",\"children\":\"Only what you type into the contact form: name, company, role, work email, optional telephone number, optional fleet size, and your message — together with the time of submission and the page the enquiry came from. There are no marketing cookies, no advertising trackers, and no visitor profiling on this site.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"3. Why we collect it\",{\"className\":\"py-7 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink sm:col-span-1\",\"children\":\"3. Why we collect it\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted sm:col-span-2 sm:mt-0\",\"children\":\"Solely so the international team can reply to you and hold a private technical research conversation about the prototypes. Your details are not used for sales, marketing, profiling, or automated follow-up; they are not sold, rented, or shared for advertising; and no contract of any kind is concluded through this site.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"4. Who processes it for us\",{\"className\":\"py-7 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink sm:col-span-1\",\"children\":\"4. Who processes it for us\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted sm:col-span-2 sm:mt-0\",\"children\":\"Form submissions are delivered by email through Resend (Resend, Inc.), our transactional email provider, and are then held in the international team mailbox. Hosting and content delivery providers process standard technical request data such as IP address and user agent in their server logs. [Placeholder — name the hosting provider once deployment is final.]\"}]]}],\"$L10\",\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"]}]]}],null,\"$L14\"]}]\na:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":\"$L16\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$18\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$L19\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2ew-m63tr2c--.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n1a:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n9:C\n10:[\"$\",\"section\",\"5. How long we keep it\",{\"className\":\"py-7 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink sm:col-span-1\",\"children\":\"5. How long we keep it\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted sm:col-span-2 sm:mt-0\",\"children\":\"Correspondence is kept for as long as the conversation is relevant to the research, and deleted on request or onc