olely so the international team can reply to you and hold a private technical research conversation about the prototypes. Your details are not used for sales, marketing, profiling, or automated follow-up; they are not sold, rented, or shared for advertising; and no contract of any kind is concluded through this site.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"4. Who processes it for us\",{\"className\":\"py-7 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink sm:col-span-1\",\"children\":\"4. Who processes it for us\"}],\"$L3\"]}],\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\",\"$L7\"]}]]}],null,\"$L8\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@9\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lb\",\"isPartial\":\"$@c\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Ld\",\"isPartial\":\"$@e\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":\"$f\"}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@10\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@11\"}\n12:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n13:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n15:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n16:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n17:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n18:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n19:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted sm:col-span-2 sm:mt-0\",\"children\":\"Form submissions are delivered by email through Resend (Resend, Inc.), our transactional email provider, and are then held in the international team mailbox. Hosting and content delivery providers process standard technical request data such as IP address and user agent in their server logs. [Placeholder — name the hosting provider once deployment is final.]\"}]\n4:[\"$\",\"section\",\"5. How long we keep it\",{\"className\":\"py-7 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink sm:col-span-1\",\"children\":\"5. How long we keep it\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted sm:col-span-2 sm:mt-0\",\"children\":\"Correspondence is kept for as long as the conversation is relevant to the research, and deleted on request or once the exchange is closed. Ask us to delete it at any time and we will.\"}]]}]\n5:[\"$\",\"section\",\"6. Your choices\",{\"className\":\"py-7 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink sm:col-span-1\",\"children\":\"6. Your choices\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted sm:col-span-2 sm:mt-0\",\"children\":\"You can ask us what we hold about you, ask us to correct or delete it, ask us to stop contacting you, or withdraw the consent you gave when submitting the form — at any time, by writing to info@maridots.com. Where data protection law grants you further rights, including the right to complain to a supervisory authority, those rights apply in full.\"}]]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"section\",\"7. International handling\",{\"className\":\"py-7 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-ink sm:col-span-1\",\"children\":\"7. International handling\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-ink-muted sm:col-span-2 sm:mt-0\",\"children\":\"Because the initiative is managed across borders — including administrative oversight in Tunisia — and uses service providers that may process data outside your country of residence, correspondence may be handled in more than one jurisdiction, under the safeguards those providers make available. [Placeholder — confirm the final provider set and their transfer mechanisms before launch.]\"}]]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"section\",\"8. Changes\",{\"className\":\"py-7 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\